    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1343" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aero</span></b>  (also written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ēro</span></b> ), ōnis,
		m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴρω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a braided</i> or <i>wicker basket</i>, <i>hamper</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aerones ex ulva palustri facti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					5, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aeronibus harenae plenis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					36, 14, 21, § 96</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Dig. 19, 2, 31</span></i>; cf. Don. ad <i><span class="en">Ter. Phorm.
				1, 2, 72</span></i>.</div>
